    "detailed_description": "<strong>BeatBeat</strong> is a funky rhythm-platformer with highly addictive Just-One-More-Try syndrome injected directly into every line of code.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1225840/extras/d1769065c8f73dc368bc23c5f4fdd12c.poster.avif?t=1745494549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1225840/extras/d1769065c8f73dc368bc23c5f4fdd12c.webm?t=1745494549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Use 100% of your brain! <strong>Rhythm</strong> AND <strong>Platforming</strong> at the same time!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1225840/extras/20f1a946e4514ec821ddbadaf9d968a5.poster.avif?t=1745494549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1225840/extras/20f1a946e4514ec821ddbadaf9d968a5.webm?t=1745494549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>\u2022\tPlayable with keyboard or gamepad!<br>\u2022\t16 song Safe-To-Stream-On-Twitch soundtrack featuring future funk, bleep bloops, and lofi hiphop beats for you to relax/study to!<br>\u2022\tSteam Workshop Integration: Download levels made by other players or create your own!<br>\u2022\tFishing minigame!<br>\u2022\tYou can pet the dog!<br>\u2022\tIn-Depth Accessibility: Adjust the game's difficulty to match your skill levels for rhythm and platforming separately.<br>\u2022\tStory: Learn more about B9, the BeatBeat Operating System's AI navigator, as B9 learns more about you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1225840/extras/0707a6f3b0485dac6fd796dc937e92f7.poster.avif?t=1745494549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1225840/extras/0707a6f3b0485dac6fd796dc937e92f7.webm?t=1745494549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
